<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Status bar icon for the run-result notification.

  A notification small icon is drawn as an alpha silhouette, so the fill
  colour is irrelevant and only the shape matters. Same Material Bluetooth
  path as ic_launcher_foreground, but at its native 24dp viewport rather
  than scaled 3x inside the 108dp adaptive-icon canvas: a small icon is
  rendered at 24dp, and a 108dp canvas would be scaled down with the glyph
  occupying only the middle third of it.
-->
